msgid "Overview of available IBM Quantum Functions for managing noise in workloads."
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan IBM Quantum Functions yang tersedia untuk menguruskan hingar dalam beban kerja."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions"
msgstr "Circuit functions"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions {#circuit-functions}"
msgstr "Circuit functions {#circuit-functions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions simplify the execution of quantum circuits by abstracting away key steps such as transpilation, error suppression, and error mitigation. Researchers using Circuit functions can focus on developing and evaluating quantum algorithms without needing to manage the complexities of optimizing circuits for quantum hardware. Circuit functions accept circuit-oriented inputs, such as PUB (Primitive Unified Bloc) objects, and return results such as mitigated expectation values. They can also serve as building blocks for creating higher-level, customized quantum applications.\n"
msgstr "Circuit functions memudahkan pelaksanaan litar kuantum dengan mengabstrakkan langkah utama seperti transpilasi, penindasan ralat dan mitigasi ralat. Penyelidik yang menggunakan Circuit functions boleh menumpukan pada membangunkan dan menilai algoritma kuantum tanpa perlu menguruskan kerumitan mengoptimumkan litar untuk perkakasan kuantum. Circuit functions menerima input berorientasikan litar, seperti objek PUB (Primitive Unified Bloc), dan mengembalikan keputusan seperti nilai jangkaan yang telah dimitigasi. Ia juga boleh berfungsi sebagai blok binaan untuk mencipta aplikasi kuantum tersuai peringkat lebih tinggi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"IBM Quantum Functions are an experimental feature available only to IBM Quantum&reg; Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](/guides/functions-get-started) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"IBM Quantum Functions ialah ciri eksperimen yang hanya tersedia kepada pengguna IBM Quantum&reg; Premium Plan, Flex Plan, dan On-Prem (melalui IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan. Rujuk [Sediakan IBM Quantum Functions](/guides/functions-get-started) untuk arahan mendapatkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

